 removeUpdatedData() failed), the\ntype was still stamped as successfully updated, and on Doris the next\nrun's window started after the changes the aborted run never published.\n\nAnalyticsTableService.create() now returns whether the update completed;\nonly completed types get their per-type last successful update\nsettings. On engines with a unique key on analytics tables (Doris), the\ncontinuous update window now starts at the per-type settings rather than\nthe shared ones, which also advance when a type was skipped or aborted.\nThis is the read path switch deferred from DHIS2-21992 (#24899), for\nDoris; Postgres still uses the shared settings.\n\ncreate() returns true when there is no source data or nothing to\nupdate, and false when the job was cancelled.\n\nCo-authored-by: Luciano Fiandesio \u003cluciano@dhis2.org\u003e\n\n🤖 AI Assisted","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"385dec080a1f046ad4acd9ddb74f090dd37cccec","tree_id":"834a772ee0975c8c986896c30ed80bc26ed0b39b","timestamp":"2026-10-01T09:29:07Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://a